{"overview":"آمانه در یک آپارتمان تنها زندگی می‌کند و زیباترین دختر مدرسه، ماهیرو، درست در کنار او زندگی می‌کند. آن‌ها تقریباً هرگز صحبت نکرده‌اند—تا روزی که او در روز بارانی در حال اضطراب او را می‌بیند و او چترش را به او می‌دهد. برای بازگرداندن لطف، او به او در کارهای خانه کمک می‌کند و رابطه‌ای آرام به تدریج شکوفا می‌شود، در حالی که فاصلهٔ بینشان کم می‌شود…","tagline":"","overview_en":"Amane lives alone in an apartment, and the most beautiful girl in school, Mahiru, lives just next door. They've almost never spoken—until the day he sees her in distress on a rainy day and lends her his umbrella. To return the favour, she offers him help around the house, and a relationship slowly begins to blossom as the distance between them closes…","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2023,"poster":"/hXhtuSNOpOrLV734jPsTRhiuu2C.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/bTUV7GOz3eAfvpD5VNrbN9QyWuV.jpg"}],"episodes":24,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"坂泰斗","role":"Amane Fujimiya (voice)","photo":"/pSExEOVmjAujKUyJJJSxC1WEzOM.jpg","en":"Taito Ban"},{"name":"ماناکا ایوامی","role":"Mahiru Shiina (voice)","photo":"/leKMaCBswXG8u4mfQNQ7J3y6Xow.jpg","en":"Manaka Iwami"},{"name":"八代拓","role":"Itsuki Akazawa (voice)","photo":"/eVdB6myaNJ4h38UU9hHHlsaCWHn.jpg","en":"Taku Yashiro"},{"name":"白石晴香","role":"Chitose Shirakawa (voice)","photo":"/hrQxTVNGLi3jXC7v4kETArpA0dV.jpg","en":"Haruka Shiraishi"}],"trailer":"b5EJ9ZkK6kE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/154743/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/154743/watch?locale=GB","p":[